on exitFrame
  [  0] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  1] pusharglist 1 ........................... <0>
  [  3] extcall 19 .............................. <marker(0)>
  [  5] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(0)>
  [  7] extcall 12 .............................. go(marker(0))
  [  9] pushint8 61 ............................. <61>
  [ 12] pusharglist 1 ........................... <61>
  [ 14] extcall 17 .............................. <rollOver(61)>
  [ 16] jmpifz [ 35] ............................ if rollOver(61) then
  [ 19] pushint8 63 ............................. <63>
  [ 22] pushint8 61 ............................. <61>
  [ 25] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 28] get 6 ................................... <the locV of sprite 61>
  [ 30] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 33] set 6 ................................... set the locV of sprite 63 to the locV of sprite 61
  [ 35] pushint8 62 ............................. <62>
  [ 38] pusharglist 1 ........................... <62>
  [ 40] extcall 17 .............................. <rollOver(62)>
  [ 42] jmpifz [ 61] ............................ if rollOver(62) then
  [ 45] pushint8 63 ............................. <63>
  [ 48] pushint8 62 ............................. <62>
  [ 51] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 54] get 6 ................................... <the locV of sprite 62>
  [ 56] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 59] set 6 ................................... set the locV of sprite 63 to the locV of sprite 62
  [ 61] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 63] extcall 18 .............................. updateStage()
  [ 65] ret
end
